  "releaseNotes": "Important Breaking Changes:\n    This is a major release where all the controls and components have been re-developed from the ground up. The name has been improved to better identify the package and it's target platform.\n    Siticone NetFrameworkUI is a .NET Framework 4.8+ UI Library for WinForms Desktop app development. This library is not for .NET Core. For .NET Core use Siticone NetCoreUI library.\n    Use this on a new project as most, if not all, components come with new names, properties and breaking changes.\n    This is the first most advanced version of the 2025 product versions, superior and more powerful.",
